      "source": "If you want to avoid writing the entire Java class name as type information and would rather like to use a key, you can use the <code>@TypeAlias</code> annotation on the entity class being persisted.\nIf you need to customize the mapping even more, look at the <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/reference/4.1/api/java/org/springframework/data/convert/TypeInformationMapper.html\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a> interface.\nAn instance of that interface can be configured at the <code>DefaultRedisTypeMapper</code>, which can be configured on <code>MappingRedisConverter</code>.",
      "translation": "如果您希望避免将整个 Java 类名作为类型信息写入，而更倾向于使用键（key），则可以在被持久化的实体类上使用 `<code>@TypeAlias</code>` 注解。  \n如果需要进一步自定义映射关系，请查看 <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/reference/4.1/api/java/org/springframework/data/convert/TypeInformationMapper.html\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a> 接口。  \n该接口的实例可以在 `<code>DefaultRedisTypeMapper`》中配置，而后者又可在 `<code>MappingRedisConverter`》中进行配置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Mapping behavior can be customized by registering the corresponding <code>Converter</code> in <code>RedisCustomConversions</code>.\nThose converters can take care of converting from and to a single <code>byte[]</code> as well as <code>Map&lt;String, byte[]&gt;</code>.\nThe first one is suitable for (for example) converting a complex type to (for example) a binary JSON representation that still uses the default mappings hash structure.\nThe second option offers full control over the resulting hash.",
      "translation": "可以通过在 <code>RedisCustomConversions</code> 中注册相应的 <code>Converter</code> 来自定义行为映射。这些转换器可以处理从单个 <code>byte[]</code> 以及 <code>Map&lt;String, byte[]&gt;</code> 的转换。前者适用于（例如）将复杂类型转换为（例如）仍使用默认映射哈希结构的二进制 JSON 表示形式。后者则提供对生成的哈希表的完全控制。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The Redis Repository support persists Objects to Hashes.\nThis requires an Object-to-Hash conversion which is done by a <code>RedisConverter</code>.\nThe default implementation uses <code>Converter</code> for mapping property values to and from Redis native <code>byte[]</code>.",
      "translation": "Redis Repository 支持将对象持久化为哈希结构。  \n这需要执行对象到哈希的转换，该转换由 `<code>RedisConverter</code>` 完成。  \n默认实现使用 `<code>Converter</code>` 将属性值映射到 Redis 原生的 `<code>byte[]</code>` 以及从 `<code>byte[]</code>` 映射回来。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The resulting document contains <code>pers</code> as the value in a <code>_class</code> field.",
      "translation": "生成的文档在 `_class` 字段中的值为 `<code>pers</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
