      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-caution\" title=\"Caution\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nDue to the flat representation structure, Map keys need to be simple types, such as <code>String</code> or <code>Number</code>.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-caution\" title=\"Caution\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n由于采用扁平化的表示结构，Map 的键必须是简单类型，例如 <code>String</code> 或 <code>Number</code>。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nCustom conversions have no effect on index resolution. <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"indexes.html\">Secondary Indexes</a> are still created, even for custom converted types.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n自定义转换不会影响索引解析。即使对于自定义转换类型，仍会创建<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"indexes.html\">二级索引</a>。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-warning\" title=\"Warning\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nWriting objects to a Redis hash deletes the content from the hash and re-creates the whole hash, so data that has not been mapped is lost.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-warning\" title=\"Warning\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n向 Redis Hash 写入对象会删除该 Hash 中的内容并重新创建整个 Hash，因此未映射的数据将会丢失。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
